4dt|a|Depending on will or discretion; not governed by any fixed rules; as, an arbitrary decision; an arbitrary punishment. ; Exercised according to one's own will or caprice, and therefore conveying a notion of a tendency to abuse the possession of power. ; Despotic; absolute in power; bound by no law; harsh and unforbearing; tyrannical; as, an arbitrary prince or government.	j:1syb,58,5;1l9d,46,4;1ecx,40,4;1l91,25,3~1syb,58,5;1ecx,40,4;1l9d,46,4;1l91,25,3	e:1xtf,58,5~1xtf,58,5
